{"id": 27, "name": "Sun", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_da4cfb603eab2b975aa8f7630881e3a9.png", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Push", "Damage"], "difficulty": "30", "stats": ["50", "50", "10", "30"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", "Jungle"], "story": "The immortal Monkey King, resolute and unyielding like the mountain that bore him.", "skills": [{"name": "Simian God", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6d93eddf722334375d384ee8965f95f7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Enemies hit by Sun and his Doppelgangers will have their Physical Defense reduced by 5% (stacks up to 6 times). Sun recovers HP equal to 75 plus 25% of the Doppelganger's Physical Attack each time a Doppelganger deals damage.\nSun and his Doppelgangers' Basic Attacks deal 50 extra damage to Creeps."}, {"name": "Endless Variety", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0d813a2495b9950a4a57fb9e750212ba.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Sun hurls his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Golden Staff</span> in the target direction, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path. Upon hitting an enemy hero or Creep, or reaching the maximum range, the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Golden Staff</span> morphs into a Doppelganger that lasts 5s and inherits 40% of Sun's attributes (and a portion of his Attack Effects).\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Endless Variety</span> and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Swift Exchange</span> are learned and upgraded together and share the same cooldown."}, {"name": "Swift Exchange", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Sun hurls his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Golden Staff</span> in the target direction, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path.\nHe conjures a Doppelganger at his location that lasts 5s and inherits 40% of his attributes (and a portion of Attack Effects). Meanwhile, Sun conceals himself and moves with the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Golden Staff</span>."}, {"name": "Instantaneous Move", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 40", "desc": "Sun commands his Doppelgangers to strike at the target enemy with him, dealing 270<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+40% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing the target and enemies behind them by 20% (can be stacked) for 1.5s. This counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects but cannot Crit."}, {"name": "Clone Techniques", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_18d2d2e16311dff12a1a8518fc823e4d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 36", "desc": "Sun summons a Doppelganger that lasts 8s and inherits 70% of his attributes and a portion of his Attack Effects. The Doppelganger takes increased damage."}], "builds": [{"lane": "JUNGLE", "winRate": 64.1, "pickRate": 2.2, "spell": {"name": "Retribution", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage